Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/lgse/strata

Package: strata
Architecture: amd64
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
# bubblewrap: every preview and thumbnail renders inside a bwrap sandbox and
# Strata fails closed without it. gvfs: Trash, Devices and network locations.
Recommends:
 bubblewrap,
 gstreamer1.0-plugins-base,
 gstreamer1.0-plugins-good,
 gvfs,
Suggests:
 ffmpeg,
 ffmpegthumbnailer,
 gstreamer1.0-libav,
 gvfs-backends,
 imagemagick,
 libraw-bin,
 squashfs-tools,
 xdg-terminal-exec,
Description: fast, keyboard-first file manager with Miller columns
 Strata is a GTK 4 file manager built around Miller columns and the
 keyboard, with inline previews for text, source code, Markdown, images,
 PDFs, media and archives.
 .
 This package installs the official upstream release binary unmodified.
 Previews need bubblewrap; Trash, Devices and network locations need gvfs.
